omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vydiWqcydWYQ7kNvwFJlxsj&_nc_oc=AdqA9GjWon18N98W7--cDan4MBOKVlrrWo1-7r64LzmGgOc44wFBO3zoxQIJPgtEpMw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ3BikoFV1QTKHafYqgS1KiLbsalJcFY_n-7Avo1KscNA&oe=6AF87CB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xofAp6x8N-4Q7kNvwHi07bx&_nc_oc=Adr2vRIAN6PElRLhopdwYR7h4u2-GUiS92x_jtjzvssQeOtTvsDqhQAj4TZZ51jZ8hE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQScgtQ76K5uv5ZchsN_vifiHeOoIY2Z0vWuXfDVExVnhA&oe=6AF87E16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8V9EuWARfgcQ7kNvwGh-e88&_nc_oc=AdrG2WOCup5PPdY64PQDKBgmbfhrs5d_t2_cM2CdqCo8DAc7drFIeJLZ4LTQkzoAmQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSiIwXQ9yvyrdYYs9YtK4y5CfBfC8kRH0ldmP5hSDUXjg&oe=6AF89337"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://